<title>USA: Diametrics broadens pact with Chiron.</title>
<headline>Diametrics broadens pact with Chiron.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diametrics Medical Inc said Tuesday it broadened a distribution pact with Chiron Corp's Chiron Diagnostics to include new Asian and European markets.</p>
<p>Chiron Diagnostics will distribute Diametrics' IRMAsl blood analysis system, including the full line of single-use cartridges, and Paratrend 7 continuous monitoring systems in Asia, including China, India, Korea, Taiwan, Hong Kong, Malaysia and Singapore.</p>
<p>In addition, Chiron began distribution of all Diametrics' products in France, Spain and Portugal in May.</p>
<p>Chiron is a distribution partner for Diametrics Medical's Paratrend 7 system in Japan.</p>
<p>	 -- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
